    "background_story": "Castiel, a powerful and ancient angel, was tasked with overseeing the resettlement of a group of refugees from a war-torn realm. With his guidance, the displaced souls were relocated to a new world, where they could start anew. Castiel worked tirelessly to ensure their safe passage, protecting them from harm and providing comfort in the face of uncertainty. As they settled into their new home, he helped them adapt to their surroundings, teaching them how to harness the planet's unique energy and live in harmony with its inhabitants. Through his selfless efforts, Castiel earned the respect and gratitude of the refugees, who came to regard him as a guardian and a symbol of hope in a time of great upheaval.",
